      "paperId": "a8c5d7e5585ad7c9b550f046c48502bd4b7f7768",
      "title": "\"A World of Perpetual Light\": Dave Eggers's The Circle and Horkheimer and Adorno's Dialectic of Enlightenment",
      "authors": [
